From 3486728a5b2ad6349582b3f43f6219e8320b431e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 04:03:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Sites: per-site release filters (must match / must not match
 regexes)

Each site gets "Must match" (any line) and "Must not match" (no line)
case-insensitive regexes, e.g. -(EGEN|NORViNE)$ to take only those groups.
Searches for missing episodes drop releases that fail a site's filters, so
the planner picks an allowed copy instead; Test search marks each result
as kept, "not matched" or "excluded". Patterns are validated on save and
run through the RSS rule matcher (titles capped against ReDoS).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013nmSf2zmYoNEfzcNutPGUX
